ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

wt --version moves the HEAD of pool worktree app-wt1 to one of the owner's commits. Only the
new HEAD reflog check (isolation.rs verify_head_moves) can see it. Machine specific: the path is a
fake pool under the verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

diff --git a/crates/wt/src/main.rs b/crates/wt/src/main.rs
index 14815cb..d27382d 100644
